axInclusive values: 1.0, 0.8, 0.6, and 0.4 metres.","regression_guard":"Preserve the upper-bound semantics: level ice thickness may be at or below the applicable Table 4-1 hi value.","blocking":true,"needs_vocabulary_resolution":false,"source":"SEMANTIC"},{"category":"LOGIC","location":"TRF-036-ship IA Super branch, nltl:levelIceThickness property shape","problem":"sh:hasValue 1.0 is applied directly to nltl:levelIceThickness, whose required value is a qudt:QuantityValue node; this incorrectly requires the property to contain the literal 1.0 in addition to satisfying the quantity-node constraint.","required_change":"Remove the direct sh:hasValue 1.0 constraint and constrain the quantity's qudt:numericValue to the intended IA Super value, with the corrected upper-bound semantics.","regression_guard":"Keep the IA Super value constraint on qudt:numericValue of the linked QuantityValue, not on the quantity property itself.","blocking":true,"needs_vocabulary_resolution":false,"source":"SEMANTIC"}],"generator_elapsed_ms":26217.323,"validator_elapsed_ms":21207.806}
